added to the City of Highland Municipal Code to read as follows:
“CHAPTER 3.40
TRANSACTIONS AND USE TAX
Sections:
3.40.010 - Short Title.
3.40.020 - Operative Date.
3.40.030 - Purpose.
3.40.040 - Contract With State
3.40.050 - Transactions Tax Rate.
